# --- From the kit's templates/portfolio-repo/gitignore ---
# Raw, uncurated job-search data never goes to GitHub
brag/inbox/
.friday-setup-state.json
*resume*
*Resume*
funnel*.csv
score.json
score.md

# Scores and reports quote your resume
*-score.json
*-score.md
composite.json
composite.md
plan.md
sync.md
screen*.json
screen*.md
quals*.json
grades*.json
linkedin*.txt
linkedin*.pdf
Profile.pdf

# --- Site exceptions ---
# The kit's *resume* rule is for resume files. The site's /resume/ page source (spec §5)
# is not one, so files and folders under src/ and tests/ are let back in. Built output
# (dist/) stays ignored below, and resume files never belong in this repo anyway.
!src/**/*resume*
!tests/**/*resume*

# --- Site build ---
node_modules/
dist/
.astro/
.wrangler/
coverage/
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Local and secrets ---
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.idea/
.vscode/
